## 🏗️ Architectural Structures

### 1. Factory Method (Inheritance-Driven)
```text
           +--------------------+
           |       Dialog       |  <-- Creator (contains business logic)
           |--------------------|
           | +renderWindow()    |
           | #createButton() *  |  <-- Factory Method (abstract)
           +---------^----------+
                     |
       +-------------+-------------+
       |                           |
+-----------------+       +-----------------+
|  WindowsDialog  |       |   LinuxDialog   |  <-- Concrete Creators
|-----------------|       |-----------------|
| +createButton() |       | +createButton() |
+--------+--------+       +--------+--------+
         | (creates)               | (creates)
         v                         v
+-----------------+       +-----------------+
|  WindowsButton  |       |   LinuxButton   |  <-- Concrete Products
+--------^--------+       +--------^--------+
         |                         |
         +-------------+-----------+
                       | (implements)
               +-------+--------+
               |     Button     |  <-- Product Interface
               +----------------+
```

### 2. Abstract Factory (Composition-Driven)
```text
         +---------------------------------------+
         |              <<interface>>            |
         |               GUIFactory              |  <-- Abstract Factory
         |---------------------------------------|
         | +createButton(): Button               |
         | +createCheckbox(): Checkbox           |
         +-------------------+-------------------+
                             ^
               +-------------+-------------+
               |                           |
     +-------------------+       +-------------------+
     |  WindowsFactory   |       |    MacFactory     |  <-- Concrete Factories
     +---------+---------+       +---------+---------+
               | (creates family)          | (creates family)
         +-----+-----+               +-----+-----+
         |           |               |           |
         v           v               v           v
    [WinButton] [WinCheckbox]   [MacButton] [MacCheckbox]
         |           |               |           |
         |           +-------+-------+           |
         |                   |                   |
         v                   v                   v
     <<Button>>        <<Checkbox>>          <<Button>>
```

